  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">P4R Senior Programme Manager/PRO UK Based (Programme Funded Role)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This role is responsible for the day-to-day management and coordination of programme delivery. It ensures that activities are well planned, risks are managed, and funding is used responsibly and in line with agreed objectives.
The role supports effective oversight by coordinating reporting, monitoring progress, and ensuring learning is captured and applied. It works closely with advisers, country teams and delivery partners to maintain quality, manage risks and support timely decision-making.
By providing strong programme management and oversight, this role helps ensure that development funding delivers intended outcomes, represents good value for money, and meets required standards.</narrative>
  </description>
